  "narration": [
    {
      "t": 0.5,
      "text": "kiln will not do anything until you have described the lane. The description lives in a particular file."
    },
    {
      "t": 7.27,
      "text": "Ask it to prepare a lane with nothing set up and it tells us exactly which file it went looking for."
    },
    {
      "t": 13.9,
      "text": "So we write that file. First the lane's name."
    },
    {
      "t": 17.56,
      "text": "Then which files make up a batch."
    },
    {
      "t": 22.8,
      "text": "And how many of them one batch holds."
    },
    {
      "t": 28.8,
      "text": "Worth reading back, because those three field names are the whole thing and nothing else will do."
    },
    {
      "t": 34.8,
      "text": "Now prepare the lane. It tells us what it found and how many pieces matched."
    },
    {
      "t": 40.8,
      "text": "And we can look at what kiln is holding. Prepared, not fired."
    },
    {
      "t": 45.58,
      "text": "Three settings in that file, then prepare the lane, and kiln knows what it is working with."
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Teaches the profile's filename and its three field names, which kiln's own help never mentions, and the name of the preparation step."
}
